# Project 02 - OSPF Routing Troubleshooting Lab

## Objective

Configure and troubleshoot OSPF routing between three Cisco routers using EVE-NG.

## Technologies Used

* OSPF
* IPv4 addressing
* /30 point-to-point links
* Cisco IOS CLI
* EVE-NG
* VPCS

## Topology

Three routers connected in a triangle topology with separate LAN networks.

## Troubleshooting Performed

* Detected missing OSPF neighbor relationship
* Found shutdown interface using `show ip interface brief`
* Fixed interface using `no shutdown`
* Verified OSPF adjacency using `show ip ospf neighbor`
* Checked routing table using `show ip route ospf`
* Fixed PC connectivity and gateway issues
* Verified successful PC-to-PC ping

## Verification Commands

```bash
show ip interface brief
show ip ospf neighbor
show ip route ospf
ping
```

## Result

Successfully established OSPF routing between all routers and verified end-to-end connectivity between PCs.
